I've had a look at the code and noticed why you probably haven't lost
any intrinsics to them yet: GREMLINS ONLY STEAL INTRINSICS AT NIGHT. If
they hit you at night, they have a one-in-ten chance of robbing you of
an intrinsic. The message is (blind) "You hear laughter", or (able to
see) "The gremlin chuckles". Also, if you happen to be polymorphed into
a clay colem, you get the message "Some writing vanishes from your
head" and you rehumanize. Does anyone have a clue why THIS happens?

By the way, "night" is defined as later than 21:00 and earlier than
6:00. Midnight (when undead are more dangerous) is 0:00 to 0:59, and
Nethack even notices Friday the 13th. Also, NetHack notices the phase
of the moon, influencing your luck but also various monsters'
reactions.
